    "answer": "⚡ **Newton's Third Law (Action & Reaction):**\n\nFor every action force exerted on a body, there is an equal and opposite reaction force exerted on the other body:\n$$\\mathbf{F_{A \\rightarrow B} = -F_{B \\rightarrow A}}$$\n• *Important Note:* Action and reaction forces act on **two different objects**, which is why they do not cancel each other out!",
